    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Clear the stages</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achieve different clear conditions for each stage by defeating or escaping from various types of ghosts. As you progress through the stages, it becomes more difficult to clear. You may not be able to clear the stage just by defeating the enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u21e9A little introduction to some of the missions\u21e9</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbDefeat 13 or more ghosts by Phase 10!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbEscape until Phase 15!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many other missions! Check them out for yourself.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Various ghosts</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various ghosts appear in each stage. Each ghost has a different way of moving and attacking. Figure out how they move.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Clear the stages</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achieve different clear conditions for each stage by defeating or escaping from various types of ghosts. As you progress through the stages, it becomes more difficult to clear. You may not be able to clear the stage just by defeating the enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u21e9A little introduction to some of the missions\u21e9</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbDefeat 13 or more ghosts by Phase 10!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbEscape until Phase 15!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many other missions! Check them out for yourself.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Various ghosts</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various ghosts appear in each stage. Each ghost has a different way of moving and attacking. Figure out how they move.</p>",
    "short_description": "Oh, it's a ghost! The seal on the rock at the shrine has been broken, and many ghosts have appeared. Work with the fox to defeat the overflowing ghosts. A single-screen 2D action game of &quot;escape x defeat&quot;.",
